        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lM7_r3GUtp_a-pTJYAW7-26" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;strokeWidth=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-wrap-mode: nowrap; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Legendas&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;1. Envia o Evento e starta o SF&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;2. Valida se o evento recebido é valido para iniciar a ingestão&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;de dados&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;3. Se é um evento valido, usamos o Glue le o arquivo no S3&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;do lake do produto&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;4. Os dados do dia informado serão baixados para o bucket&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;do landing no formato .parquet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;5. O segundo step function é o harmonização, onde vamos&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;buscar o arquivo .parquet&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;gerado pelo step anterior e transformar ele para o nosso domain transformando&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;6. Para cada evento recebido, devemos ter um de-para pronto para transformar o&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;layout do produto no nosso layout. Esse layout será um json por produto. Assim o código do glue continua generico e cada layout terá um tratamento diferente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;7. O arquivo transformado no nosso dominio deve ser salvo no bucket s3-harmonizado&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;8. Busca o arquivo já harmonizado para o nosso domain no bucket do produto/curated/&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;9. Como é um processamento batch, vamos usar tabelas de mesh que estão no glue das informações que precisamos enriquecer e assim podemos fazer um enriquecimento em batch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;10. Com o arquivo totalmente pronto, vamos mover ele para curated/ e devemos gerar um evento de novo arquivo no s3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;11.Será enviado um evento quando um novo arquivo for adicionado na pasta /curated do s3 - Enriquecimento para um SQS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;12. Um serviço ECS irá receber esse evento e iniciar o processamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;13. O ECS deve ler o inserido e postar os eventos no SNS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;14. Eventos lidos e postados no SNS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;15. SNS irá encaminhar os eventos para as filsa de destino corretas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Demais Requisitos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;O DynamoDB Config também terá os registro para controlar o processamento&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;PK: produto#anomesdia#tipoArquivo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;SK: executionId&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;status: RECEIVED | LANDING | HARMONIZED | ENRICHED | PUBLISHED | FAILED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;inputPath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;outputPath&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;recordCount&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;createdAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;updatedAt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;checksum/hash opcional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1750" width="480" x="1520" y="-80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lM7_r3GUtp_a-pTJYAW7-14" edge="1" parent="1" source="lM7_r3GUtp_a-pTJYAW7-11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="lM7_r3GUtp_a-pTJYAW7-10">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="670" y="289" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
